ave other tech channels linked on my channel page whose content I like to consume in the programming/cybersec space. I added this section in hopes that it can point you to other channels that leave you feeling inspired about tech :)\n\n(I personally find it hard to find &quot;related channels&quot; for my favourite creators so I hope this helps)","postId":"UgkxU_OZuSmXcmCLlAqyf41jaGjd7i79OLc2","authorThumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/Aksxhi2HYBuUC2-z61mrlNQ899oL7lOk867Us4oWoJfmVFJPJjVLXWy0UZFdBNidhnpp1-MUFw=s76-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":76,"height":76},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/Aksxhi2HYBuUC2-z61mrlNQ899oL7lOk867Us4oWoJfmVFJPJjVLXWy0UZFdBNidhnpp1-MUFw=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":48,"height":48},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/Aksxhi2HYBuUC2-z61mrlNQ899oL7lOk867Us4oWoJfmVFJPJjVLXWy0UZFdBNidhnpp1-MUFw=s32-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":32,"height":32}],"publishedTime":1776353452045,"voteCount":699,"postContent":{"type":"image","content":[{"url":"https://yt3.ggpht.com/x0MVY7BoXFKcfGbOaJIlzo7-WSjRJ5PbSAesbfC6GFLFehALkbSe7zpLxSE7aF49rk7jHV5tCR5sUg=s640-c-fcrop64=1,0be40000deffffff-rw-nd-v1","width":640,"height":640}]},"commentCount":41,"authorId":"UC9H0HzpKf5JlazkADWnW1Jw","author":"bashbunni","type":"community"},{"postText":"new spring live stream schedule until JUNE ⸜(｡˃ ᵕ ˂ )⸝♡ (yes we will be learning rust and building new projects)","postId":"UgkxEz8PoqEwnpLY0fAbgPdgopUh3YzoOrkr","authorThumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/Aksxhi2HYBuUC2-z61mrlNQ899oL7lOk867Us4oWoJfmVFJPJjVLXWy0UZFdBNidhnpp1-MUFw=s76-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":76,"height":76},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/Aksxhi2HYBuUC2-z61mrlNQ899oL7lOk867Us4oWoJfmVFJPJjVLXWy0UZFdBNidhnpp1-MUFw=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":48,"height":48},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/Aksxhi2HYBuUC2-z61mrlNQ899oL7lOk867Us4oWoJfmVFJPJjVLXWy0UZFdBNidhnpp1-MUFw=s32-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":32,"height":32}],"publishedTime":1776353452045,"voteCount":244,"postContent":{"type":"image","content":[{"url":"https://yt3.ggpht.com/YSOBa7d5Mn-Z_9I1YWsWjqyqhLNNx2WzBmTPQupb7udhANxAZRMb41A-g73F-Py1tgrjaRXiL18Igw=s640-c-fcrop64=1,00000000ffffffff-rw-nd-v1","width":640,"height":640}]},"commentCount":8,"authorId":"UC9H0HzpKf5JlazkADWnW1Jw","author":"bashbunni","type":"community"},{"postText":"💖 Thank you YouTube community for your support and endless good vibes. I&apos;m very grateful to get to connect so many incredible people. And thank you to my sponsors for the opportunity to dedicate my time to creating a cozy online space for developers.\n\nI&apos;ll keep pushing myself to grow and use my platform to support the developer community :)\n\nFollow up to <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/post/UgkxeydCJB7yNu1qKijurDaRkFrwF1hqwZ5r\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">youtube.com/post/UgkxeydCJB7yNu1qKijurDaRkFrwF1hqwZ5r</a>","postId":"UgkxvynlAu4DfC-fUuUJidhbCahMVWCTUU8A","authorThumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/Aksxhi2HYBuUC2-z61mrlNQ899oL7lOk867Us4oWoJfmVFJPJjVLXWy0UZFdBNidhnpp1-MUFw=s76-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":76,"height":76},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/Aksxhi2HYBuUC2-z61mrlNQ899oL7lOk867Us4oWoJfmVFJPJjVLXWy0UZFdBNidhnpp1-MUFw=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":48,"height":48},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/Aksxhi2HYBuUC2-z61mrlNQ899oL7lOk867Us4oWoJfmVFJPJjVLXWy0UZFdBNidhnpp1-MUFw=s32-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":32,"height":32}],"publishedTime":1776353452045,"voteCount":381,"postContent":{"type":"image","content":[{"url":"https://yt3.ggpht.com/R1H48SOeBxC-mXBtgAm6a3ufrKwLj_Qdj_IGtMXuE63oghlo_EgWBe999dXP3-fNmI3RHeAskLhknA=s640-c-fcrop64=1,00000000ffffffff-rw-nd-v1","width":640,"height":640}]},"commentCount":8,"authorId":"UC9H0HzpKf5JlazkADWnW1Jw","author":"bashbunni","type":"community"},{"postText":"Hey all, thank you for your support while I&apos;ve had more sponsorships than usual (I have another ad integration coming in an upcoming video, they all kinda ended up around the same time). To be completely transparent, I&apos;ve been experimenting with all partnership formats to figure out what can provide the least intrusive yet genuinely valuable brand collaborations. I&apos;ve been reading all of your comments as your thoughts throughout this transition are really important to me.\n\nAs a thank you, I&apos;d like to sponsor your favourite open source projects this month. Let me know in the comments which projects you rely on and I&apos;ll choose from the most upvoted options.\n\nI&apos;m making a big effort to bring in sponsors in the most ethical ways possible and have been incredibly selective in who I work with and to keep any messaging in my own voice and as relevant as possible to you. I won&apos;t be able to please everyone here, but I&apos;ll keep trying my best to be a source of positivity and comfort in the tech space :)","postId":"UgkxeydCJB7yNu1qKijurDaRkFrwF1hqwZ5r","authorThumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/Aksxhi2HYBuUC2-z61mrlNQ899oL7lOk867Us4oWoJfmVFJPJjVLXWy0UZFdBNidhnpp1-MUFw=s76-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":76,"height":76},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/Aksxhi2HYBuUC2-z61mrlNQ899oL7lOk867Us4oWoJfmVFJPJjVLXWy0UZFdBNidhnpp1-MUFw=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":48,"height":48},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/Aksxhi2HYBuUC2-z61mrlNQ899oL7lOk867Us4oWoJfmVFJPJjVLXWy0UZFdBNidhnpp1-MUFw=s32-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":32,"height":32}],"publishedTime":1776353452045,"voteCount":483,"postContent":null,"commentCount":44,"authorId":"UC9H0HzpKf5JlazkADWnW1Jw","author":"bashbunni","type":"community"},{"postText":"I feel like I get brain worms when coding so I need some form of background noise. I end up just listening to the same music and podcasts all the time and I need something NEW! What are you all listening to while coding?","postId":"UgkxsxBl-wry1q9rDCfZm5K5c4EKNQsoGlCk","authorThumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/Aksxhi2HYBuUC2-z61mrlNQ899oL7lOk867Us4oWoJfmVFJPJjVLXWy0UZFdBNidhnpp1-MUFw=s76-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":76,"height":76},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/Aksxhi2HYBuUC2-z61mrlNQ899oL7lOk867Us4oWoJfmVFJPJjVLXWy0UZFdBNidhnpp1-MUFw=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":48,"height":48},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/Aksxhi2HYBuUC2-z61mrlNQ899oL7lOk867Us4oWoJfmVFJPJjVLXWy0UZFdBNidhnpp1-MUFw=s32-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":32,"height":32}],"publishedTime":1776353452045,"voteCount":356,"postContent":null,"commentCount":151,"authorId":"UC9H0HzpKf5JlazkADWnW1Jw","author":"bashbunni","type":"community"}],"communityPostsTimestamp":{"$$date":1791905452045},"liveStreams":[{"type":"video","videoId":"PuapCroNCbQ","title":"cozy coding THEN overwatch","author":"bashbunni","authorId":"UC9H0HzpKf5JlazkADWnW1Jw","viewCount":42000,"published":1791559845508,"lengthSeconds":17599,"liveNow":false,"isUpcoming":false,"isStation":false,"isPremiere":false},{"type":"video","videoId":"dxUPceiXKWg","title":"REACTING TO TECH CULTURE | cozy + canadian","author":"bashbunni","authorId":"UC9H0HzpKf5JlazkADWnW1Jw","viewCount":17000,"published":1791473445508,"lengthSeconds":9886,"liveNow":false,"isUpcoming":false,"isStation":false,"isPremiere":false},{"type":"video","videoId":"Nx5yf0QWeW8","title":"day 1: learning about compilers until I cry (or rage quit) !book !awards","author":"bashbunni","authorId":"UC9H0HzpKf5JlazkADWnW1Jw","viewCount":28000,"published":1790868645508,"lengthSeconds":14669,"liveNow":false,"isUpcoming":false,"isStation":false,"isPremiere":false},{"type":"video","videoId":"8jOx9ALxzvE","title":"learning from nushell's source code","author":"bashbunni","authorId":"UC9H0HzpKf5JlazkADWnW1Jw","viewCount":32000,"published":1790695845508,"lengthSeconds":8463,"liveNow":false,"isUpcoming":false,"isStation":false,"isPremiere":false},{"type":"video","videoId":"FKyxxa01iKM","title":"No-code game mods? Reacting to Mastodon, co