{"_id":"UCAiiOTio8Yu69c3XnR7nQBQ","communityPosts":[{"postText":"Going live in about an hour on Flux Harmonic! We&apos;ll be building a MUD from scratch in Sigil, my own Scheme, with a modern web interface streamed over Server-Side Events. Come watch me write a game by hand, live.\n\nMy live streams happen over on Flux Harmonic now, so come join me here: <a href=\"https://youtube.com/live/zcj1tknMlPY\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">youtube.com/live/zcj1tknMlPY</a>","postId":"Ugkxf3RW4iIYsXA8mvadXdhZDWMeRGv4Vh9Z","authorThumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ytc/AIdro_lyKTyQXxB_3HJ08fFXcD3EAJUzMll3LWVs9g5bpYmt=s76-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":76,"height":76},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ytc/AIdro_lyKTyQXxB_3HJ08fFXcD3EAJUzMll3LWVs9g5bpYmt=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":48,"height":48},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ytc/AIdro_lyKTyQXxB_3HJ08fFXcD3EAJUzMll3LWVs9g5bpYmt=s32-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":32,"height":32}],"publishedTime":1784129452210,"voteCount":10,"postContent":null,"commentCount":1,"authorId":"UCAiiOTio8Yu69c3XnR7nQBQ","author":"System Crafters","type":"community"},{"postText":"Crafter Hours stream schedule this week has been shifted to Wednesday and Thursday.  Hopefully back to normal next week!","postId":"UgkxrqoMjS_N9plH2WW870sjfiSPactx03Sz","authorThumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ytc/AIdro_lyKTyQXxB_3HJ08fFXcD3EAJUzMll3LWVs9g5bpYmt=s76-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":76,"height":76},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ytc/AIdro_lyKTyQXxB_3HJ08fFXcD3EAJUzMll3LWVs9g5bpYmt=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":48,"height":48},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ytc/AIdro_lyKTyQXxB_3HJ08fFXcD3EAJUzMll3LWVs9g5bpYmt=s32-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":32,"height":32}],"publishedTime":1760348500210,"voteCount":21,"postContent":null,"commentCount":1,"authorId":"UCAiiOTio8Yu69c3XnR7nQBQ","author":"System Crafters","type":"community"},{"postText":"Hey Crafters!\n\nUnfortunately tonight&apos;s stream won&apos;t take place because I came down with some kind of virus overnight.  We&apos;ll be back next week with another Crafter Hours stream on Monday/Wednesday and the usual stream on Friday!\n\nIn the meantime, check out the video I just posted about using the `match` expression in Guile Scheme!","postId":"UgkxkrdVCvV3uSx3PLyHHAFXZn1jEBkULZh4","authorThumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ytc/AIdro_lyKTyQXxB_3HJ08fFXcD3EAJUzMll3LWVs9g5bpYmt=s76-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":76,"height":76},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ytc/AIdro_lyKTyQXxB_3HJ08fFXcD3EAJUzMll3LWVs9g5bpYmt=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":48,"height":48},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ytc/AIdro_lyKTyQXxB_3HJ08fFXcD3EAJUzMll3LWVs9g5bpYmt=s32-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":32,"height":32}],"publishedTime":1760348500211,"voteCount":10,"postContent":{"type":"video","content":{"type":"video","videoId":"pxu7m2oCmyA","title":"A Primer on Match Expressions in Scheme - Learning Guile Scheme","author":"System Crafters","authorId":"UCAiiOTio8Yu69c3XnR7nQBQ","description":"In this video, I explain the 'match' expression in Scheme and show a number of examples for how it can be used both for destructuring of information in Scheme data types and to encode more...","viewCount":4295,"published":1760348500211,"lengthSeconds":1820,"liveNow":false,"isUpcoming":false,"isPremiere":false,"is4k":false,"is8k":false,"isNew":false,"isVr180":false,"isVr360":false,"is3d":false,"hasCaptions":false}},"commentCount":2,"authorId":"UCAiiOTio8Yu69c3XnR7nQBQ","author":"System Crafters","type":"community"},{"postText":"Hey Crafters!  As I mentioned on last week&apos;s stream, I&apos;m out of town this week so there will be no Friday stream.  Join us back next Friday, January 3rd, for the next one.\n\nHope you all had a great holiday and have a happy new year!","postId":"Ugkx3iq_JIotkg-L1tG-PGE8yNMovVmlDip7","authorThumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ytc/AIdro_lyKTyQXxB_3HJ08fFXcD3EAJUzMll3LWVs9g5bpYmt=s76-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":76,"height":76},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ytc/AIdro_lyKTyQXxB_3HJ08fFXcD3EAJUzMll3LWVs9g5bpYmt=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":48,"height":48},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ytc/AIdro_lyKTyQXxB_3HJ08fFXcD3EAJUzMll3LWVs9g5bpYmt=s32-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":32,"height":32}],"publishedTime":1760348500211,"voteCount":48,"postContent":null,"commentCount":1,"authorId":"UCAiiOTio8Yu69c3XnR7nQBQ","author":"System Crafters","type":"community"},{"postText":"Hey Crafters!  Just a quick note that today&apos;s stream (11/22) will not take place due to family obligations.  We&apos;ll be back next Friday (11/29) with our regularly scheduled stream!\n\nKeep an eye out for the new video on Git Reflog within the next couple of days!","postId":"UgkxkmzVrDYlF4ZENFPnWk5jtz-aAsHlnItX","authorThumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ytc/AIdro_lyKTyQXxB_3HJ08fFXcD3EAJUzMll3LWVs9g5bpYmt=s76-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":76,"height":76},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ytc/AIdro_lyKTyQXxB_3HJ08fFXcD3EAJUzMll3LWVs9g5bpYmt=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":48,"height":48},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ytc/AIdro_lyKTyQXxB_3HJ08fFXcD3EAJUzMll3LWVs9g5bpYmt=s32-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":32,"height":32}],"publishedTime":1760348500211,"voteCount":62,"postContent":null,"commentCount":2,"authorId":"UCAiiOTio8Yu69c3XnR7nQBQ","author":"System Crafters","type":"community"},{"postText":"Hey folks!\n\nI made a classic error last Friday: promising a video on a specific date.  It turns out that the 1yr old was more sick than I was, so we&apos;ve spent the last few days in the hospital.  Everyone is better now, but I&apos;m way behind on video production.  Will try to get the video out in the next couple of days!","postId":"Ugkxn_934Edi7EbGhttckeTs7b8Xv9DOW06J","authorThumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ytc/AIdro_lyKTyQXxB_3HJ08fFXcD3EAJUzMll3LWVs9g5bpYmt=s76-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":76,"height":76},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ytc/AIdro_lyKTyQXxB_3HJ08fFXcD3EAJUzMll3LWVs9g5bpYmt=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":48,"height":48},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ytc/AIdro_lyKTyQXxB_3HJ08fFXcD3EAJUzMll3LWVs9g5bpYmt=s32-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":32,"height":32}],"publishedTime":1728791548211,"voteCount":80,"postContent":null,"commentCount":10,"authorId":"UCAiiOTio8Yu69c3XnR7nQBQ","author":"System Crafters","type":"community"},{"postText":"I&apos;m going to have time available soon to hack on free software projects and live stream it! \n\nWhich type(s) of project would you be most interested to see?","postId":"UgkxyQiO9DdV6RJSMEtU7l7qB5p-lYitrTC7","authorThumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ytc/AIdro_lyKTyQXxB_3HJ08fFXcD3EAJUzMll3LWVs9g5bpYmt=s76-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":76,"height":76},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ytc/AIdro_lyKTyQXxB_3HJ08fFXcD3EAJUzMll3LWVs9g5bpYmt=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":48,"height":48},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ytc/AIdro_lyKTyQXxB_3HJ08fFXcD3EAJUzMll3LWVs9g5bpYmt=s32-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":32,"height":32}],"publishedTime":1728791548211,"voteCount":30,"postContent":{"type":"poll","totalVotes":394,"content":[{"text":"Contributing to Guix (features and user experience)","image":null},{"text":"Contributing to Guile Scheme and its ecosystem","image":null},{"text":"General configuration hacking (Emacs, Guix, Linux)","image":null},{"text":"Game development and creative hacking","image":null}]},"commentCount":10,"authorId":"UCAiiOTio8Yu69c3XnR7nQBQ","author":"System Crafters","type":"community"},{"postText":"Join us at the new System Crafters Forum!  If you&apos;ve got questions about Emacs, Guix, or other related topics, this is the place to ask them.  Feel free to share your own personal projects, too!\n