エンジニア、Gitのブランチの練習をする！！ (#csharp #git  )","author":"Ichika","authorId":"UCAsUKYMDlolvZyHAAzr1xhA","viewCount":3500,"published":1789313445622,"lengthSeconds":8923,"liveNow":false,"isUpcoming":false,"isStation":false,"isPremiere":false}],"liveStreamsTimestamp":{"$$date":1791905445622},"communityPosts":[{"postText":"【お知らせ】\nこんにちか～🌸\n今日と明日は、配信おやすみします！\n会社員のほうがバタバタしていて、今日明日はそっちに集中したいと思います🙏\nガンバリマッシュ!୧(๑•̀⌄•́๑)૭✧\n\n次回の配信は10/10(土)！\nお楽しみに～✨️みんな今日も良い夢みてねん♪\n次回の配信：<a href=\"https://youtube.com/live/6kcY1szXmi8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">youtube.com/live/6kcY1szXmi8</a>\n\n【Notice】\nHi, Kon-nichika!🌸\nI will be skipping my 22:00 (JST) streams for today and tomorrow!\nThings have been a bit hectic at my day job recently, so I want to focus on that for the next two days.🙏 I&apos;ll do my best!୧(๑•̀⌄•́๑)૭✧\n\n\nMy next stream will be on Saturday, October 10th!\nLook forward to it✨️ Have sweet dreams♪\nNext stream: <a href=\"https://youtube.com/live/6kcY1szXmi8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">youtube.com/live/6kcY1szXmi8</a>","postId":"UgkxV41T2taYgwBCUeypXFep0lD9HDjqkrqM","authorThumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/IXWHhQQ1Dium7AVxs0YXsED0Zj7B8BgdyrDywlUBqt0KX5u4zlRCMr5uCUVr3UrSqN8MdYTRFw=s76-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":76,"height":76},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/IXWHhQQ1Dium7AVxs0YXsED0Zj7B8BgdyrDywlUBqt0KX5u4zlRCMr5uCUVr3UrSqN8MdYTRFw=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":48,"height":48},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/IXWHhQQ1Dium7AVxs0YXsED0Zj7B8BgdyrDywlUBqt0KX5u4zlRCMr5uCUVr3UrSqN8MdYTRFw=s32-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":32,"height":32}],"publishedTime":1791473452120,"voteCount":43,"postContent":null,"commentCount":5,"authorId":"UCAsUKYMDlolvZyHAAzr1xhA","author":"いちか - Ichika","type":"community"},{"postText":"【お知らせ】\n10/2の配信ですが、パソコンの電源がつかなくなってしまったため、お休みします😭😭\n\nお知らせが遅くなってすみません…\n配信用のデスクトップパソコンがつかず、配信時間の変更が間に合いませんでした🥲\n\n(スマホからは変更できなくて、ノートパソコンからやっと変更できたよ⭐)\n\n明日も、パソコンの調子によってはお休みになるかもしれません…\nそうなったら本当にすみません(T_T)\nパソコンさん、金曜日で疲れ果てたのかな😭😭\n\nパソコンの状態がわかり次第、またご報告します🙇🏻‍♀️\n\nーーー\n\n【Notice】\nI&apos;m taking a break from today&apos;s stream (Oct 2) because my PC won&apos;t turn on 😭😭\nSorry for the late notice…\n\nMy streaming desktop wouldn&apos;t start, so I couldn&apos;t change the stream time in time 🥲\n\n(I couldn&apos;t change it from my phone, but I finally managed to do it from my laptop ⭐)\n\nDepending on how my PC is doing, I might have to skip tomorrow&apos;s stream too…\nI&apos;m really sorry if that happens.\n\nMaybe my PC is just worn out because it&apos;s Friday 😭😭\n\nI&apos;ll give you another update as soon as I know what&apos;s going on with my PC 🙇🏻‍♀️","postId":"UgkxvSsQLlGbM_j5Ypp7A9iv72Yo_eknXq2-","authorThumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/IXWHhQQ1Dium7AVxs0YXsED0Zj7B8BgdyrDywlUBqt0KX5u4zlRCMr5uCUVr3UrSqN8MdYTRFw=s76-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":76,"height":76},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/IXWHhQQ1Dium7AVxs0YXsED0Zj7B8BgdyrDywlUBqt0KX5u4zlRCMr5uCUVr3UrSqN8MdYTRFw=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":48,"height":48},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/IXWHhQQ1Dium7AVxs0YXsED0Zj7B8BgdyrDywlUBqt0KX5u4zlRCMr5uCUVr3UrSqN8MdYTRFw=s32-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":32,"height":32}],"publishedTime":1790955052120,"voteCount":50,"postContent":null,"commentCount":8,"authorId":"UCAsUKYMDlolvZyHAAzr1xhA","author":"いちか - Ichika","type":"community"},{"postText":"【お知らせ】\n\n今日は365日達成記念の次の日だったので\n記念でコース料理を食べました。\n\nそして、眠気が過去最大限に到来中！！！\n\n今から寝ることにします！ごめんよ😭😭\n配信は明日の22時から予定です。\n\nそんでもって、明日も元気にお勉強するぞー🔥\nGitHubの草を育てます🌱\n\nおやすみなさ〜い💤\nみんないい夢見てねん🫶🏻✨️\n\n<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/live/aBP6xrGekuw?si=L22mbszp7j-6qNu8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">youtube.com/live/aBP6xrGekuw?si=L22mbszp7j-6qNu8</a>\n\nーーー\n\n【Notice】 \n\nToday was the day after achieving 365 days, so I ate a full-course meal to celebrate. \n\nAnd, sleepiness is arriving at the maximum ever!!! \n\nI&apos;m going to sleep now! Sorry😭😭\nThe stream is scheduled for tomorrow from 22:00. \n\nAnd also, I&apos;ll study energetically tomorrow tooー🔥\nI&apos;ll grow GitHub grass🌱 \n\nGood night〜💤\nEveryone, have a good dream🫶🏻✨️ \n\n<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/live/aBP6xrGekuw?si=L22mbszp7j-6qNu8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">youtube.com/live/aBP6xrGekuw?si=L22mbszp7j-6qNu8</a>","postId":"Ugkxx0Cg_dQxP5rxCiY7YQ1QmqnYU_A2KCan","authorThumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/IXWHhQQ1Dium7AVxs0YXsED0Zj7B8BgdyrDywlUBqt0KX5u4zlRCMr5uCUVr3UrSqN8MdYTRFw=s76-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":76,"height":76},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/IXWHhQQ1Dium7AVxs0YXsED0Zj7B8BgdyrDywlUBqt0KX5u4zlRCMr5uCUVr3UrSqN8MdYTRFw=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":48,"height":48},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/IXWHhQQ1Dium7AVxs0YXsED0Zj7B8BgdyrDywlUBqt0KX5u4zlRCMr5uCUVr3UrSqN8MdYTRFw=s32-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":32,"height":32}],"publishedTime":1790695852121,"voteCount":62,"postContent":null,"commentCount":6,"authorId":"UCAsUKYMDlolvZyHAAzr1xhA","author":"いちか - Ichika","type":"community"},{"postText":"【お知らせ】\n\nこんちか🌸\n今日はお友達と遊ぶため\n配信はおやすみします🙇🏻‍♀️\n\n美味しいもの（たこ焼き）食べてくるねー！！！\nみんながいい夢見れますように🫶🏻\n\n\nーーー\n\n【Notice】\nKonchika🌸\nI’m taking today off from streaming to hang out with friends🙇🏻‍♀️\n\nI&apos;m gonna go eat some delicious food!!!（takoyaki）\n\nHope you all have sweet dreams🫶🏻","postId":"UgkxuHQM9EBMgA7G-HTLyj2J-XSxLV2J3DIt","authorThumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/IXWHhQQ1Dium7AVxs0YXsED0Zj7B8BgdyrDywlUBqt0KX5u4zlRCMr5uCUVr3UrSqN8MdYTRFw=s76-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":76,"height":76},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/IXWHhQQ1Dium7AVxs0YXsED0Zj7B8BgdyrDywlUBqt0KX5u4zlRCMr5uCUVr3UrSqN8MdYTRFw=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":48,"height":48},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/IXWHhQQ1Dium7AVxs0YXsED0Zj7B8BgdyrDywlUBqt0KX5u4zlRCMr5uCUVr3UrSqN8MdYTRFw=s32-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":32,"height":32}]