{"_id":"UCJaEGe7IYRz4_f42DyeUU1w","communityPosts":[{"postText":"here&apos;s an awesome project by <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCS7HbhVfNftBpiUKg7mHBog\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">youtube.com/channel/UCS7HbhVfNftBpiUKg7mHBog</a> using an add-on board to enable any pocket operator to be played like a maraca. &apos;the pocket integrator&apos; adds tempo control, analog sync, midi sync (over usb-c and trs), usb power and much more. order yours to support this crowd funded invention over at <a href=\"https://www.crowdsupply.com/msl/pocket-integrator\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">crowdsupply.com/msl/pocket-integrator</a>","postId":"UgkxKawUHRpKNycuTElI3Jky1As39zIVUKo1","authorThumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/zaxVgbVGp_aNGFzkflDASUHD8VV46CFTbVNR526Gt0gZKWATxKDnBSpePe5JOaDTjudBlo2IAg=s76-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":76,"height":76},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/zaxVgbVGp_aNGFzkflDASUHD8VV46CFTbVNR526Gt0gZKWATxKDnBSpePe5JOaDTjudBlo2IAg=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":48,"height":48},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/zaxVgbVGp_aNGFzkflDASUHD8VV46CFTbVNR526Gt0gZKWATxKDnBSpePe5JOaDTjudBlo2IAg=s32-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":32,"height":32}],"publishedTime":1697234596161,"voteCount":35,"postContent":{"type":"video","content":{"type":"video","videoId":"4h2pu6CDvWI","title":"The Pocket Integrator, explained","author":"mykle hansen","authorId":"UCS7HbhVfNftBpiUKg7mHBog","description":"It's the add-on board for Teenage Engineering's Pocket Operators that lets you play your drum machine like a drum!  With tap-tempo & tap-downbeat features designed for live jamming, plus a...","viewCount":7009,"published":1665677644161,"lengthSeconds":126,"liveNow":false,"isUpcoming":false,"isPremiere":false,"is4k":false,"is8k":false,"isNew":false,"isVr180":false,"isVr360":false,"is3d":false,"hasCaptions":false}},"commentCount":2,"authorId":"UCJaEGe7IYRz4_f42DyeUU1w","author":"teenage engine