od community adopted FOSS | Akhila Somanath | Venkatesh Hariharan","published":1716977803000,"viewCount":426,"type":"video","lengthSeconds":"0:00","isRSS":true},{"authorId":"UCOcAzaATg6pCruLkpHX5adA","author":"FOSS United","videoId":"10P_me7-yGI","title":"Unlocking the secret of Software Patents | Patent litigation | FOSS United | Venkatesh Hariharan","published":1716289323000,"viewCount":893,"type":"video","lengthSeconds":"0:00","isRSS":true},{"authorId":"UCOcAzaATg6pCruLkpHX5adA","author":"FOSS United","videoId":"e9x17fhrUw0","title":"FOSS Explained","published":1711958186000,"viewCount":3441,"type":"video","lengthSeconds":"0:00","isRSS":true},{"authorId":"UCOcAzaATg6pCruLkpHX5adA","author":"FOSS United","videoId":"lYWVk6RCAHQ","title":"Curious about what Tech4Good is? Hear it from Akhila herself.","published":1707316733000,"viewCount":568,"type":"video","lengthSeconds":"0:00","isRSS":true},{"authorId":"UCOcAzaATg6pCruLkpHX5adA","author":"FOSS United","videoId":"67U02-mUcNc","title":"Sneak Peek Alert! Our next guest for the #UnitedByFOSS podcast is Akhila, co-founder of Tech4Good.","published":1707305170000,"viewCount":436,"type":"video","lengthSeconds":"0:00","isRSS":true}],"shortsTimestamp":{"$$date":1791905440412},"communityPosts":[{"postText":"The IndiaFOSS 2024 schedule is now live! \n\nCheck the schedule here: <a href=\"https://fossunited.org/indiafoss/2024/schedule\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">fossunited.org/indiafoss/2024/schedule</a>\n\nGrab your tickets at <a href=\"http://fossunited.org/indiafoss/2024\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">fossunited.org/indiafoss/2024</a>\n\n<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/indiafoss\">#IndiaFOSS</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/fossunited\">#FOSSUnited</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/unitedbyfoss\">#UnitedByFOSS</a>","postId":"Ugkxdkmzx06V0JmlmRL5vOkYgO7WQ4uIWsva","authorThumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ytc/AIdro_kkZy3dixW9U0RpD37CRvEIvDQqKfpTgdJzQ6_dsCK50w=s76-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":76,"height":76},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ytc/AIdro_kkZy3dixW9U0RpD37CRvEIvDQqKfpTgdJzQ6_dsCK50w=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":48,"height":48},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ytc/AIdro_kkZy3dixW9U0RpD37CRvEIvDQqKfpTgdJzQ6_dsCK50w=s32-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":32,"height":32}],"publishedTime":1728791548107,"voteCount":7,"postContent":{"type":"image","content":[{"url":"https://yt3.ggpht.com/i6xnm__cJi72tSRduDXzLAoBo2OPLk5JOeap7hYSu9DHPgikwLTTsNvuq5rZz8t9MM4ecS1uVqyHLg=s640-c-fcrop64=1,00000000ffffffff-rw-nd-v1","width":640,"height":640}]},"commentCount":null,"authorId":"UCOcAzaATg6pCruLkpHX5adA","author":"FOSS United","type":"community"},{"postText":"Kovid Goyal creator of Calibre &amp; kitty shares concerns about the potential harm of software patents in India, highlighting the challenges they pose for innovation and development within the software industry.\n\n<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/softwarepatents\">#Softwarepatents</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/clibrekitty\">#clibrekitty</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/fossunited\">#FOSSUnited</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/fossexplained\">#FOSSExplained</a>","postId":"UgkxIRPk5GQ2JM51JwMW75KDndA4OJ0T7Lqv","authorThumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ytc/AIdro_kkZy3dixW9U0RpD37CRvEIvDQqKfpTgdJzQ6_dsCK50w=s76-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":76,"height":76},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ytc/AIdro_kkZy3dixW9U0RpD37CRvEIvDQqKfpTgdJzQ6_dsCK50w=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":48,"height":48},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ytc/AIdro_kkZy3dixW9U0RpD37CRvEIvDQqKfpTgdJzQ6_dsCK50w=s32-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":32,"height":32}],"publishedTime":1728791548107,"voteCount":5,"postContent":{"type":"multiImage","content":[[{"url":"https://yt3.ggpht.com/6hjhyex59Yw2uIZBiRazJQWbaU6NtEHc8k8Vs5_5omqCtsYoO1OPpTx2ke8y9VR3c8Cw8lsF4ViQaw=s640-c-fcrop64=1,00000000ffffffff-rw-nd-v1","width":640,"height":640}],[{"url":"https://yt3.ggpht.com/llIrdmb-T0b4LVBpP6umzdRwzgjWoXLo_hKQ8_WwfDmIklFA3d48EUM87cGD9xWzPK_bsGaccE28Kw=s640-c-fcrop64=1,00000000ffffffff-rw-nd-v1","width":640,"height":640}]]},"commentCount":1,"authorId":"UCOcAzaATg6pCruLkpHX5adA","author":"FOSS United","type":"community"},{"postText":"Exciting news 🎉 \nRegistrations are now open for the fourth edition of <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/fosshack\">#FOSSHack</a> .\nJoin us for an action-packed weekend of coding, learning, and fun. This year, hack virtually or at one of our 10+ local editions all over India!\nRegister now!\n\n<a href=\"https://fossunited.org/fosshack/2024\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">fossunited.org/fosshack/2024</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/fossunited\">#fossunited</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/hackathon\">#hackathon</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/fosshack\">#fosshack</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/unitedbyfoss\">#unitedbyfoss</a>","postId":"UgkxYGY8h8tYfwd6oocQLoK1vemB6DjU7R76","authorThumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ytc/AIdro_kkZy3dixW9U0RpD37CRvEIvDQqKfpTgdJzQ6_dsCK50w=s76-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":76,"height":76},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ytc/AIdro_kkZy3dixW9U0RpD37CRvEIvDQqKfpTgdJzQ6_dsCK50w=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":48,"height":48},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ytc/AIdro_kkZy3dixW9U0RpD37CRvEIvDQqKfpTgdJzQ6_dsCK50w=s32-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":32,"height":32}],"publishedTime":1728791548108,"voteCount":5,"postContent":{"type":"image","content":[{"url":"https://yt3.ggpht.com/QiIf8UgXqTF1354dNdgiyB64K-vtkolMt1qEENReTeaWiQu5abT19e9Gkd2FlEdiKyAU8jVQ8GVEFA=s640-c-fcrop64=1,00000000ffffffff-rw-nd-v1","width":640,"height":640}]},"commentCount":null,"authorId":"UCOcAzaATg6pCruLkpHX5adA","author":"FOSS United","type":"community"},{"postText":"Get your tickets to be a part of the ultimate Free and Open Source Software and Hardware flagship on 7th and 8th of September. General tickets are open now, Get yours! \n\nHere&apos;s the link: <a href=\"https://fossunited.org/dashboard/buy-tickets?event=93baa1a4d5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">fossunited.org/dashboard/buy-tickets?event=93baa1a4d5</a>\n\n <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/indiafoss2024\">#indiafoss2024</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/fossunited\">#fossunited</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/unitedbyfoss\">#unitedbyfoss</a>","postId":"UgkxWRzI65ViGz8zjuL2pbKrZvVzD_0b6obN","authorThumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ytc/AIdro_kkZy3dixW9U0RpD37CRvEIvDQqKfpTgdJzQ6_dsCK50w=s76-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":76,"height":76},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ytc/AIdro_kkZy3dixW9U0RpD37CRvEIvDQqKfpTgdJzQ6_dsCK50w=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":48,"height":48},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ytc/AIdro_kkZy3dixW9U0RpD37CRvEIvDQqKfpTgdJzQ6_dsCK50w=s32-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":32,"height":32}],"publishedTime":1728791548108,"voteCount":6,"postContent":{"type":"image","content":[{"url":"https://yt3.ggpht.com/_7E3Izs4axu597MqiqBegJPu5ETTHLyweGXN6kgRtP2bKhmkFc_yE4f68okFb3Gp2UEJ9yYkZAFt3w=s640-c-fcrop64=1,00000000ffffffff-rw-nd-v1","width":640,"height":640}]},"commentCount":null,"authorId":"UCOcAzaATg6pCruLkpHX5adA","author":"FOSS United","type":"community"},{"postText":"FOSS Hack 2021 opening notes is scheduled for 8AM tomorrow (13-11-2021)!","postId":"UgkxOYxTr1sBy8YJX-hZcdSrb8hm_ng8aPud","authorThumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ytc/AIdro_kkZy3dixW9U0RpD37CRvEIvDQqKfpTgdJzQ6_dsCK50w=s76-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":76,"height":76},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ytc/AIdro_kkZy3dixW9U0RpD37CRvEIvDQqKfpTgdJzQ6_dsCK50w=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":48,"height":48},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ytc/AIdro_kkZy3dixW9U0RpD3