ings: This Insane Planet Puts Saturn's Rings to Shame","published":1673987625000,"viewCount":6436560,"type":"video","lengthSeconds":"0:00","isRSS":true},{"authorId":"UCR9sFzaG9Ia_kXJhfxtFMBA","author":"melodysheep","videoId":"ZHlenYEeNz0","title":"Zombie Planets: The freakiest worlds in the universe","published":1672877400000,"viewCount":4625123,"type":"video","lengthSeconds":"0:00","isRSS":true}],"shortsTimestamp":{"$$date":1791905440332},"communityPosts":[{"postText":"one week until the new Life Beyond drops.  hold on to your butts","postId":"UgkxrLoq-aJhbtt4sST2brgS-PFkgbr-2od8","authorThumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ytc/AIdro_klHVaP6_ZcnT8VyPFedRHgJOPOym_tLSxoFCL0KJSZL1k=s76-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":76,"height":76},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ytc/AIdro_klHVaP6_ZcnT8VyPFedRHgJOPOym_tLSxoFCL0KJSZL1k=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":48,"height":48},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ytc/AIdro_klHVaP6_ZcnT8VyPFedRHgJOPOym_tLSxoFCL0KJSZL1k=s32-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":32,"height":32}],"publishedTime":1768577452096,"voteCount":5300,"postContent":{"type":"image","content":[{"url":"https://yt3.ggpht.com/hhGj4GMf7yV44J3G-fcDKa-a05rFz1nW4nrMxz4Ly8FKVp5fqy1KoFD_lMMdyIbCr37liSVwcv8=s640-c-fcrop64=1,00003333ffffcccc-rw-nd-v1","width":640,"height":640}]},"commentCount":270,"authorId":"UCR9sFzaG9Ia_kXJhfxtFMBA","author":"melodysheep","type":"community"},{"postText":"Just 2 weeks until ENGINEERING EARTH. You&apos;ve been patient. I hope it&apos;s worth the wait.  See you on June 3rd :)","postId":"UgkxbHBpiWGLFBI481u4uSJzCjhREBwc1Ajr","authorThumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ytc/AIdro_klHVaP6_ZcnT8VyPFedRHgJOPOym_tLSxoFCL0KJSZL1k=s76-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":76,"height":76},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ytc/AIdro_klHVaP6_ZcnT8VyPFedRHgJOPOym_tLSxoFCL0KJSZL1k=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":48,"height":48},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ytc/AIdro_klHVaP6_ZcnT8VyPFedRHgJOPOym_tLSxoFCL0KJSZL1k=s32-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":32,"height":32}],"publishedTime":1760348500096,"voteCount":527,"postContent":{"type":"video","content":{"type":"video","videoId":"PUtBWd6CNZQ","title":"Engineering Earth -- Final Teaser","author":"melodysheep","authorId":"UCR9sFzaG9Ia_kXJhfxtFMBA","description":"June 3rd. Hold on to your butt","viewCount":147950,"published":1760348500096,"lengthSeconds":48,"liveNow":false,"isUpcoming":false,"isPremiere":false,"is4k":false,"is8k":false,"isNew":false,"isVr180":false,"isVr360":false,"is3d":false,"hasCaptions":false}},"commentCount":42,"authorId":"UCR9sFzaG9Ia_kXJhfxtFMBA","author":"melodysheep","type":"community"},{"postText":"Announcement!  The IMAX film I worked on, DEEP SKY, is coming to 300 theaters across North America for 1 week for Earth day on April 19. The initial theater run was very limited, so if you missed the film the first time around, now is your chance. The film is fantastic  — seeing the James Webb Space telescope images (and my visuals) on the IMAX screen is awesome.\n\nFor a list of theaters or to buy tickets, go to <a href=\"http://imax.com/deepsky\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">imax.com/deepsky</a>.","postId":"Ugkx9PgN2OxpGSW0npWprTQ5whloMYz4PxCt","authorThumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ytc/AIdro_klHVaP6_ZcnT8VyPFedRHgJOPOym_tLSxoFCL0KJSZL1k=s76-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":76,"height":76},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ytc/AIdro_klHVaP6_ZcnT8VyPFedRHgJOPOym_tLSxoFCL0KJSZL1k=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":48,"height":48},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ytc/AIdro_klHVaP6_ZcnT8VyPFedRHgJOPOym_tLSxoFCL0KJSZL1k=s32-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":32,"height":32}],"publishedTime":1728791548096,"voteCount":9900,"postContent":{"type":"image","content":[{"url":"https://yt3.ggpht.com/oIfiO3E189KEcYjDkp_sPeaP027THJOxyVHge27iSnMt4qwcjDlhbd-N8Xz1rDdhnjMUg3-eI4uf=s640-c-fcrop64=1,26800000d97fffff-rw-nd-v1","width":640,"height":640}]},"commentCount":491,"authorId":"UCR9sFzaG9Ia_kXJhfxtFMBA","author":"melodysheep","type":"community"},{"postText":"TIMELAPSE OF THE FUTURE was released 5 years ago today. I&apos;m eternally grateful for the staggering response to this project. It&apos;s been life-changing and career-altering in the best possible way. Thank you all. I released a special edition poster to mark the 5th anniversary of the project, you can find it on sale here: <a href=\"http://melodysheep.shop/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">melodysheep.shop</a>","postId":"Ugkx1fSKC4pz2ibPBRVFK596ZSw0RWBHj-dU","authorThumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ytc/AIdro_klHVaP6_ZcnT8VyPFedRHgJOPOym_tLSxoFCL0KJSZL1k=s76-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":76,"height":76},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ytc/AIdro_klHVaP6_ZcnT8VyPFedRHgJOPOym_tLSxoFCL0KJSZL1k=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":48,"height":48},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ytc/AIdro_klHVaP6_ZcnT8VyPFedRHgJOPOym_tLSxoFCL0KJSZL1k=s32-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":32,"height":32}],"publishedTime":1728791548096,"voteCount":7600,"postContent":{"type":"image","content":[{"url":"https://yt3.ggpht.com/yw_aKug-Aq98PoaYnLitcPnTBAVlzPU4qV4R45eKSzfljCMq5nsYev1khOEXsXx4Zk2W-INPuH3oe4M=s640-c-fcrop64=1,00002068ffffdf97-rw-nd-v1","width":640,"height":640}]},"commentCount":287,"authorId":"UCR9sFzaG9Ia_kXJhfxtFMBA","author":"melodysheep","type":"community"},{"postText":"","postId":"UgkxzjsVCyJ9kVI6Upmv6uwTvAWoIu-Vv0PO","authorThumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ytc/AIdro_klHVaP6_ZcnT8VyPFedRHgJOPOym_tLSxoFCL0KJSZL1k=s76-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":76,"height":76},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ytc/AIdro_klHVaP6_ZcnT8VyPFedRHgJOPOym_tLSxoFCL0KJSZL1k=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":48,"height":48},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ytc/AIdro_klHVaP6_ZcnT8VyPFedRHgJOPOym_tLSxoFCL0KJSZL1k=s32-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":32,"height":32}],"publishedTime":1728791548096,"voteCount":1500,"postContent":{"type":"image","content":[{"url":"https://yt3.ggpht.com/OMT1wp69qNI56PMY3A7L61njik7nIRd1ZqKLSuWRcDKMhX9VtC2IP1_h2IG__VijGyoSuNLwzihV7w=s640-c-fcrop64=1,00000000ffffffff-rw-nd-v1","width":640,"height":640}]},"commentCount":29,"authorId":"UCR9sFzaG9Ia_kXJhfxtFMBA","author":"melodysheep","type":"community"},{"postText":"Save the date.  THE HUMAN FUTURE drops on August 15.  Casting my stone in the opposite direction of all the pessimists out there.  see you soon :)","postId":"UgkxQSeWdoCyu4f8QC4Rqqq2OTvfTUU8pkjG","authorThumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ytc/AIdro_klHVaP6_ZcnT8VyPFedRHgJOPOym_tLSxoFCL0KJSZL1k=s76-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":76,"height":76},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ytc/AIdro_klHVaP6_ZcnT8VyPFedRHgJOPOym_tLSxoFCL0KJSZL1k=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":48,"height":48},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ytc/AIdro_klHVaP6_ZcnT8VyPFedRHgJOPOym_tLSxoFCL0KJSZL1k=s32-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":32,"height":32}],"publishedTime":1697234596096,"voteCount":7300,"postContent":{"type":"image","content":[{"url":"https://yt3.ggpht.com/7CFh0HeCsVSD9UfK1LSc9imflCpKDZT41gNjj_qehvRKt0J9fgmjw2tYjf4oMpbsn0BagczFhx_TTQ=s640-c-fcrop64=1,00002000ffffdfff-rw-nd-v1","width":640,"height":640}]},"commentCount":436,"authorId":"UCR9sFzaG9Ia_kXJhfxtFMBA","author":"melodysheep","type":"community"},{"postText":"Hey guys -- I&apos;m doing a reddit AMA today to talk about my work on a new HBO series called HIGH SCIENCE.  Come on by and ask me some questions! <a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/television/comments/12t65nc/were_matt_klinman_zack_poitras_and_john_boswell/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">reddit.com/r/television/comments/12t65nc/were_matt_klinman_zack_poitras_and_john_boswell</a>","postId":"UgkxJZ0EkJZegvC-pxDl1eDKWr0txbqB-srU","authorThumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ytc/AIdro_klHVaP6_ZcnT8VyPFedRHgJOPOym_tLSxoFCL0K