ounds, eras and countless people who have shaped NCS along the way. ❤️\n\nFrom artists taking their first steps with NCS to going on to do incredible things together. From the OG YouTube days to taking over TikTok, streaming and whatever comes next, NCS has evolved alongside the internet and the people who make it.\n\nNew artists and genres continue to find a home here, while the songs that shaped our history still have a way of finding their moment in the spotlight.\n\nAnd the best part? There’s still so much more to discover...\n\nTo every artist, creator and music lover who has been part of the journey, thank you for making NCS what it is today.\n\n15 years in, and the next chapter is already underway. 🟡","postId":"Ugkx7qxH8kHcNIYtoi9CqZYRPtTywkvBPUOE","authorThumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/opGwWu2ScRBy-OA81LIzKwSatxlVKjjNyAdt4fWh4LoLzldx05Sdf3OGQz0Fz78ziZ9RLP4=s76-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":76,"height":76},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/opGwWu2ScRBy-OA81LIzKwSatxlVKjjNyAdt4fWh4LoLzldx05Sdf3OGQz0Fz78ziZ9RLP4=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":48,"height":48},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/opGwWu2ScRBy-OA81LIzKwSatxlVKjjNyAdt4fWh4LoLzldx05Sdf3OGQz0Fz78ziZ9RLP4=s32-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":32,"height":32}],"publishedTime":1789313452130,"voteCount":5700,"postContent":{"type":"image","content":[{"url":"https://yt3.ggpht.com/9yj6hJ79vko3XWLJZbHlS169_XO09-qJNtP5_86M6PtU4InDJNt9MCerrreK2Y85MEJc-VvC9LnsDw=s640-c-fcrop64=1,29990000d666ffff-rw-nd-v1","width":640,"height":640}]},"commentCount":297,"authorId":"UC_aEa8K-EOJ3D6gOs7HcyNg","author":"NoCopyrightSounds","type":"community"},{"postText":"NCS vs Monstercat: 15 Year Anniversary \n\nIt&apos;s time to settle this once and for all...\nAfter 15 years, the two biggest internet labels are facing each other in 6 rounds across 6 weeks. 🟠😼\n\nAre you <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/teamncs\">#TeamNCS</a> or <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/teamm