{"_id":"UC_flDR5aKfSmPMsFGR4B7EA","communityPosts":[{"postText":"Just a heads up: I had a &quot;Making A Beat At 11 PM&quot; moment with my new song. Mostly minor mistakes and oversights. While i can&apos;t replace the youtube version, bandcamp is a different story, so please go listen to this song on bandcamp for a definitive experience instead, lol.\r\n<a href=\"https://nu11.bandcamp.com/track/break-enter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">nu11.bandcamp.com/track/break-enter</a>","postId":"UgkxMqKkK04tCQKQZoTcFH94JdApv-T1iQQm","authorThumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ptbYaHRm5nEY0z-JbBZp3Z708tgEY7fBlIt6xinjEpWTrBJyNxNQhcYoBqiyxJy6q6SRHnc0i38=s76-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":76,"height":76},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ptbYaHRm5nEY0z-JbBZp3Z708tgEY7fBlIt6xinjEpWTrBJyNxNQhcYoBqiyxJy6q6SRHnc0i38=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":48,"height":48},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ptbYaHRm5nEY0z-JbBZp3Z708tgEY7fBlIt6xinjEpWTrBJyNxNQhcYoBqiyxJy6q6SRHnc0i38=s32-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":32,"height":32}],"publishedTime":1771169452095,"voteCount":29,"postContent":null,"commentCount":null,"authorId":"UC_flDR5aKfSmPMsFGR4B7EA","author":"nu11","type":"community"},{"postText":"I finished my new song a few days ago, now i&apos;m just waiting until i can submit it to botb Winter Chip (hopefully)","postId":"UgkxccUy9Q-jvbUAx_UZNNQy6kPdC1N5CdFI","authorThumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ptbYaHRm5nEY0z-JbBZp3Z708tgEY7fBlIt6xinjEpWTrBJyNxNQhcYoBqiyxJy6q6SRHnc0i38=s76-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":76,"height":76},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ptbYaHRm5nEY0z-JbBZp3Z708tgEY7fBlIt6xinjEpWTrBJyNxNQhcYoBqiyxJy6q6SRHnc0i38=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":48,"height":48},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ptbYaHRm5nEY0z-JbBZp3Z708tgEY7fBlIt6xinjEpWTrBJyNxNQhcYoBqiyxJy6q6SRHnc0i38=s32-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":32,"height":32}],"publishedTime":1768577452095,"voteCount":16,"postContent":null,"commentCount":2,"authorId":"UC_flDR5aKfSmPMsFGR4B7EA","author":"nu11","type":"community"},{"postText":"I&apos;m happy to announce a new release coming soon. It will have 3 remakes of my old songs, and it will also have songs that weren&apos;t included in my previous album.","postId":"Ugkxv98UxPYWEP6nWpGpgulFubuNKXVs7p0v","authorThumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ptbYaHRm5nEY0z-JbBZp3Z708tgEY7fBlIt6xinjEpWTrBJyNxNQhcYoBqiyxJy6q6SRHnc0i38=s76-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":76,"height":76},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ptbYaHRm5nEY0z-JbBZp3Z708tgEY7fBlIt6xinjEpWTrBJyNxNQhcYoBqiyxJy6q6SRHnc0i38=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":48,"height":48},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ptbYaHRm5nEY0z-JbBZp3Z708tgEY7fBlIt6xinjEpWTrBJyNxNQhcYoBqiyxJy6q6SRHnc0i38=s32-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":32,"height":32}],"publishedTime":1763393452095,"voteCount":34,"postContent":null,"commentCount":6,"authorId":"UC_flDR5aKfSmPMsFGR4B7EA","author":"nu11","type":"community"},{"postText":"I&apos;ve released an album that has most of my songs I previously wrote during 2018-2025, you can get it on bandcamp, you can download it for free or name your price.\n<a href=\"https://nu11.bandcamp.com/album/famitracker-works\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">nu11.bandcamp.com/album/famitracker-works</a>","postId":"UgkxBNuRgqTNi4uFUEnnVeTf6aBZrzQgxZB5","authorThumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ptbYaHRm5nEY0z-JbBZp3Z708tgEY7fBlIt6xinjEpWTrBJyNxNQhcYoBqiyxJy6q6SRHnc0i38=s76-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":76,"height":76},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ptbYaHRm5nEY0z-JbBZp3Z708tgEY7fBlIt6xinjEpWTrBJyNxNQhcYoBqiyxJy6q6SRHnc0i38=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":48,"height":48},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ptbYaHRm5nEY0z-JbBZp3Z708tgEY7fBlIt6xinjEpWTrBJyNxNQhcYoBqiyxJy6q6SRHnc0i38=s32-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":32,"height":32}],"publishedTime":1760348500095,"voteCount":39,"postContent":null,"commentCount":2,"authorId":"UC_flDR5aKfSmPMsFGR4B7EA","author":"nu11","type":"community"},{"postText":"I hope you&apos;re ready for yet another new song from me in the February, it&apos;s almost done. It&apos;s on a smaller scale compared to my previous one, but that&apos;s normal since I&apos;ve only spent around two weeks writing it so far.","postId":"UgkxZtu-nTNue-kZWbuUnZNX5qyUPKxb8M97","authorThumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ptbYaHRm5nEY0z-JbBZp3Z708tgEY7fBlIt6xinjEpWTrBJyNxNQhcYoBqiyxJy6q6SRHnc0i38=s76-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":76,"height":76},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ptbYaHRm5nEY0z-JbBZp3Z708tgEY7fBlIt6xinjEpWTrBJyNxNQhcYoBqiyxJy6q6SRHnc0i38=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":48,"height":48},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ptbYaHRm5nEY0z-JbBZp3Z708tgEY7fBlIt6xinjEpWTrBJyNxNQhcYoBqiyxJy6q6SRHnc0i38=s32-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":32,"height":32}],"publishedTime":1760348500095,"voteCount":71,"postContent":null,"commentCount":8,"authorId":"UC_flDR5aKfSmPMsFGR4B7EA","author":"nu11","type":"community"},{"postText":"January 2025. Remember this date. One month left before you will get to witness something that i still can&apos;t believe i was able to make in the first place. It took me two weeks to write my last song. The new upcoming one took me almost two months. The only thing i can say for certain is that you&apos;re not ready for this.","postId":"UgkxZ0_RDrcg-DeAGlEjO9IKW3IDAhmUm_mo","authorThumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ptbYaHRm5nEY0z-JbBZp3Z708tgEY7fBlIt6xinjEpWTrBJyNxNQhcYoBqiyxJy6q6SRHnc0i38=s76-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":76,"height":76},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ptbYaHRm5nEY0z-JbBZp3Z708tgEY7fBlIt6xinjEpWTrBJyNxNQhcYoBqiyxJy6q6SRHnc0i38=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":48,"height":48},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ptbYaHRm5nEY0z-JbBZp3Z708tgEY7fBlIt6xinjEpWTrBJyNxNQhcYoBqiyxJy6q6SRHnc0i38=s32-c-k-c0x0