"hwrpRDQzows","title":"I made the first virus for my Operating System - OS Dev From Scratch","author":"Developed From Scratch","authorId":"UCbUqONVVqQY4OHwr7vr22hA","viewCount":3000,"published":1760348522922,"lengthSeconds":1011,"liveNow":false,"isUpcoming":false,"isStation":false,"isPremiere":false},{"type":"video","videoId":"pr8xW9xflaE","title":"Input with XHCI - OS Dev From Scratch Part 4","author":"Developed From Scratch","authorId":"UCbUqONVVqQY4OHwr7vr22hA","viewCount":4900,"published":1760348522922,"lengthSeconds":2317,"liveNow":false,"isUpcoming":false,"isStation":false,"isPremiere":false},{"type":"video","videoId":"ZaaXpaRL6Sc","title":"All about processes - OS Dev from scratch Part 3","author":"Developed From Scratch","authorId":"UCbUqONVVqQY4OHwr7vr22hA","viewCount":10000,"published":1760348522922,"lengthSeconds":2880,"liveNow":false,"isUpcoming":false,"isStation":false,"isPremiere":false},{"type":"video","videoId":"RBPwpFfsQiY","title":"Exceptions and Memory protection - OS Dev from scratch Part 2","author":"Developed From Scratch","authorId":"UCbUqONVVqQY4OHwr7vr22hA","viewCount":16000,"published":1760348522922,"lengthSeconds":2277,"liveNow":false,"isUpcoming":false,"isStation":false,"isPremiere":false},{"type":"video","videoId":"X82l37rAnP8","title":"I made an operating system from scratch - OS Dev from scratch Part 1 - Setup","author":"Developed From Scratch","authorId":"UCbUqONVVqQY4OHwr7vr22hA","viewCount":218000,"published":1760348522922,"lengthSeconds":2316,"liveNow":false,"isUpcoming":false,"isStation":false,"isPremiere":false}],"videosTimestamp":{"$$date":1791905474922},"communityPosts":[{"postText":"As of a couple weeks ago, I started streaming exclusively to Twitch.\nI created a dedicated channel for VODs, at <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDy4NkAIE22-OoAUJrfrWag\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">youtube.com/channel/UCDy4NkAIE22-OoAUJrfrWag</a> \nI&apos;ll continue to post them here for a bit, but I&apos;ll eventually make it exclusive to that channel and delete them off here to keep this channel cleaner\nTwitch channel: <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/differrari\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">twitch.tv/differrari</a>","postId":"UgkxOAplTcuypWQYgMndS5rKUiFr9ZFdimAv","authorThumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/dsLk58YYwJ87e-Ya8Afm1QhlrEn0JXNetZnP9Od57q3p4FgWD38RtN3mZ98Pr31J57-ksrJ8=s76-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":76,"height":76},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/dsLk58YYwJ87e-Ya8Afm1QhlrEn0JXNetZnP9Od57q3p4FgWD38RtN3mZ98Pr31J57-ksrJ8=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":48,"height":48},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/dsLk58YYwJ87e-Ya8Afm1QhlrEn0JXNetZnP9Od57q3p4FgWD38RtN3mZ98Pr31J57-ksrJ8=s32-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":32,"height":32}],"publishedTime":1789313452132,"voteCount":7,"postContent":null,"commentCount":3,"authorId":"UCbUqONVVqQY4OHwr7vr22hA","author":"Developed From Scratch","type":"community"},{"postText":"Live streams will be twitch-only for the foreseeable future. \nThe channel will remain for the time being. \n<a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/differrari\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">twitch.tv/differrari</a>","postId":"UgkxzVd0u_fH6wsF0jO_ydvyVG15ebYN__RU","authorThumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/dsLk58YYwJ87e-Ya8Afm1QhlrEn0JXNetZnP9Od57q3p4FgWD38RtN3mZ98Pr31J57-ksrJ8=s76-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":76,"height":76},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/dsLk58YYwJ87e-Ya8Afm1QhlrEn0JXNetZnP9Od57q3p4FgWD38RtN3mZ98Pr31J57-ksrJ8=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":48,"height":48},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/dsLk58YYwJ87e-Ya8Afm1QhlrEn0JXNetZnP9Od57q3p4FgWD38RtN3mZ98Pr31J57-ksrJ8=s32-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":32,"height":32}],"publishedTime":1786721452132,"voteCount":6,"postContent":null,"commentCount":null,"authorId":"UCbUqONVVqQY4OHwr7vr22hA","author":"Developed From Scratch","type":"community"},{"postText":"This week, the channel reached 10K subscribers! \nAs promised, I&apos;ll be porting DOOM to [REDACTED] OS to celebrate the milestone.\nI&apos;ll be live streaming it starting today, and posting a video of the process once it&apos;s done. Make sure to tune in Today at 8:30PM CEST","postId":"UgkxwqyNAkQj7N21Kg4P5bhlXPFWVXH9e47M","authorThumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/dsLk58YYwJ87e-Ya8Afm1QhlrEn0JXNetZnP9Od57q3p4FgWD38RtN3mZ98Pr31J57-ksrJ8=s76-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":76,"height":76},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/dsLk58YYwJ87e-Ya8Afm1QhlrEn0JXNetZnP9Od57q3p4FgWD38RtN3mZ98Pr31J57-ksrJ8=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":48,"height":48},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/dsLk58YYwJ87e-Ya8Afm1QhlrEn0JXNetZnP9Od57q3p4FgWD38RtN3mZ98Pr31J57-ksrJ8=s32-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":32,"height":32}],"publishedTime":1760348500132,"voteCount":0,"postContent":{"type":"video","content":{"type":"video","videoId":"rBlDHmArFes","title":"Operating System Development Stream | DOOM PORT | 10k SPECIAL","author":"Developed From Scratch","authorId":"UCbUqONVVqQY4OHwr7vr22hA","description":"Porting DOOM to [REDACTED] OS\nGithub: https://github.com/differrari/RedactedOS\nDiscord: https://discord.gg/W2hPv2FbuJ\nTwitch: https://www.twitch.tv/developedfromscratch\nYouTube: https://www.youtube...","viewCount":669,"published":1760348500132,"lengthSeconds":14717,"liveNow":false,"isUpcoming":false,"isPremiere":false,"is4k":false,"is8k":false,"isNew":false,"isVr180":false,"isVr360":false,"is3d":false,"hasCaptions":false}},"commentCount":null,"authorId":"UCbUqONVVqQY4OHwr7vr22hA","author":"Developed From Scratch","type":"community"},{"postText":"I was hoping to have a video of the system actually running on real hardware for today, but I&apos;ve been dealing with back to back (to back) crashes and issues, so we&apos;re not quite there yet. To continue asking about possible video formats I might do in the future, should I livestream some OS Dev content, so you can watch me argue with a thinking rock in real time?","postId":"UgkxPfGPj0Xp7b8h57xUgXR4M7dtZ1ERybUD","authorThumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/dsLk58YYwJ87e-Ya8Afm1QhlrEn0JXNetZnP9Od57q3p4FgWD38RtN3mZ98Pr31J57-ksrJ8=s76-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":76,"height":76},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/dsLk58YYwJ87e-Ya8Afm1QhlrEn0JXNetZnP9Od57q3p4FgWD38RtN3mZ98Pr31J57-ksrJ8=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":48,"height":48},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/dsLk58YYwJ87e-Ya8Afm1QhlrEn0JXNetZnP9Od57q3p4FgWD38RtN3mZ98Pr31J57-ksrJ8=s32-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":32,"height":32}],"publishedTime":1760348500132,"voteCount":10,"postContent":{"type":"poll","totalVotes":172,"content":[{"text":"Yes","image":null},{"text":"No","image":null}]},"commentCount":5,"authorId":"UCbUqONVVqQY4OHwr7vr22hA","author":"Developed From Scratch","type":"community"},{"postText":"Feels weird to not be editing a video for this week. Hardware port is going as well as that kind of thing can go, but since it&apos;s time to start expanding the type of content I make, and I want to learn more about OS architecture: would you be interested in seeing videos exploring this topic? Maybe putting QEMU to work and running a few of the more experimental systems and see how they work?","postId":"UgkxAAJVT4KPXkkHwqH56BGHl0awx7aTqB_e","authorThumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/dsLk58YYwJ87e-Ya8Afm1QhlrEn0JXNetZnP9Od57q3p4FgWD38RtN3mZ98Pr31J57-ksrJ8=s76-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":76,"height":76},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/dsLk58YYwJ87e-Ya8Afm1QhlrEn0JXNetZnP9Od57q3p4FgWD38RtN3mZ98Pr31J57-ksrJ8=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":48,"height":48},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/dsLk58YYwJ87e-Ya8Afm1QhlrEn0JXNetZnP9Od57q3p4FgWD38RtN3mZ98Pr31J57-ksrJ8=s32-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":32,"height":32}],"publishedTime":1760348500132,"voteCount":12,"postContent":{"type":"poll","totalVotes":132,"content":[{"text":"Yes","image":null},{"text":"No","image":null}]},"commentCount":null,"authorId":"UCbUqONVVqQY4OHwr7vr22hA","author":"Developed From Scratch","type":"community"},{"postText":"Since videos will be slowing down from now on, and I also don&apos;t get much of a chance to talk to people who watch my videos, I&apos;m creating a new discord server to chat all things [REDACTED] OS and anything else. \n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/hxKtJZSpuh\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">discord.gg/hxKtJZSpuh</a>\nCome hang out, chat about projects you&apos;re working on, give feedback on [REDACTED] defend microsoft or just chat!","postId":"UgkxIX68emTKIyRT5-yZP7ZEx1R3hDHgUbrl","authorThumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/dsLk58YYwJ87e-Ya8Afm1QhlrEn0JXNetZnP9Od57q3p4FgWD38RtN3mZ98Pr31J57-ksrJ8=s76-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":76,"height":76},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/dsLk58YYwJ87e-Ya8Afm1QhlrEn0JXNetZnP9Od57q3p4FgWD38RtN3mZ98Pr31J57-ksrJ8=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":48,"height":48},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/dsLk58YYwJ87e-Ya8Afm1QhlrEn0JXNetZnP9Od57q3p4FgWD38RtN3mZ98Pr31J57-ksrJ8=s32-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":32,"height":32}],"publishedTime":1760348500132,"voteCount":29,"postContent":null,"commentCount":7,"authorId":"UCbUqONVVqQY4OHwr7vr22hA","author":"Developed From Scratch","type":"community"},{"postText":"Third REDACTED OS DevLog is now up!\nAfter this, I have one more video centered around the development process of REDACTED OS. I&apos;m nowhere near done with the creation of this system, and it&apos;s a project I&apos;m enjoying a lot and certainly not planning to abandon anytime soon, but now that videos are catching up to the current state of the OS, it&apos;s time to start looking to expanding the type of content I make. \nIf you want to see me focus on any new projects, especially ones that can be integrated into REDACTED OS, make your voice heard. Add any other suggestions in comments as well!\nI do have one or two more video ideas I probably will make related to REDACTED OS before starting any new projects, and I&apos;m not making any promises on what&apos;ll come next, but I do want to hear opinions.\nWhat do you think the next project should be?","postId":"Ugkxo2cgBUlZznLkToWlSoHAxXQjtJZqvJmm","authorThumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/dsLk58YYwJ87e-Ya8Afm1QhlrEn0JXNetZnP9Od57q3p4FgWD38RtN3mZ98Pr31J57-ksrJ8=s76-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":76,"height":76},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/dsLk58YYwJ87e-Ya8Afm1QhlrEn0JXNetZnP9Od57q3p4FgWD38RtN3mZ98Pr31J57-ksrJ8=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":48,"height":48},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/dsLk58YYwJ87e-Ya8Afm1QhlrEn0JXNetZnP9Od57q3p4FgWD38RtN3mZ98Pr31J57-ksrJ8=s32-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":32,"height":32}],"publishedTime":1760348500133,"voteCount":27,"postContent":{"type":"poll","totalVotes":424,"content":[{"text":"A compiler","image":null},{"text":"A game engine","image":null},{"text":"Networking for REDACTED OS","image":null},{"text":"Other (comments)","image":null}]},"commentCount":12,"authorId":"UCbUqONVVqQY4OHwr7vr22hA","author":"Developed From Scratch","type":"community"},{"postText":"In case you missed it, the github repo for REDACTED OS is up. \nIt’s not the cleanest or most efficient code, but there’s always time to improve that in the future. \n<a href=\"https://github.com/differrari/RedactedOS\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">github.com/differrari/RedactedOS</a>","postId":"UgkxZfH2oFQfKbZsf1DxqjgXi9jkMzecmKks","authorThumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/dsLk58YYwJ87e-Ya8Afm1QhlrEn0JXNetZnP9Od57q3p4FgWD38RtN3mZ98Pr31J57-ksrJ8=s76-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":76,"height":76},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/dsLk58YYwJ87e-Ya8Afm1QhlrEn0JXNetZnP9Od57q3p4FgWD38RtN3mZ98Pr31J57-ksrJ8=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":48,"height":48},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/dsLk58YYwJ87e-Ya8Afm1QhlrEn0JXNetZnP9Od57q3p4FgWD38RtN3mZ98Pr31J57-ksrJ8=s32-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":32,"height":32}],"publishedTime":1760348500133,"voteCount":38,"postContent":null,"commentCount":2,"authorId":"UCbUqONVVqQY4OHwr7vr22hA","author":"Developed From Scratch","type":"community"},{"postText":"For anyone looking to get started creating an operative system in QEMU, here&apos;s a tutorial I wish I&apos;d found when I started. It&apos;s essentially what I did in my video, but all in one place.\nOSDev Wiki is a great resource, although I find there&apos;s not a lot of information for ARM development\n<a href=\"https://wiki.osdev.org/QEMU_AArch64_Virt_Bare_Bones\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">wiki.osdev.org/QEMU_AArch64_Virt_Bare_Bones</a>","postId":"Ugkxz2y4rOVoCvzwb4AS6FNO3p6gPHQj54U4","authorThumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/dsLk58YYwJ87e-Ya8Afm1QhlrEn0JXNetZnP9Od57q3p4FgWD38RtN3mZ98Pr31J57-ksrJ8=s76-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":76,"height":76},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/dsLk58YYwJ87e-Ya8Afm1QhlrEn0JXNetZnP9Od57q3p4FgWD38RtN3mZ98Pr31J57-ksrJ8=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":48,"height":48},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/dsLk58YYwJ87e-Ya8Afm1QhlrEn0JXNetZnP9Od57q3p4FgWD38RtN3mZ98Pr31J57-ksrJ8=s32-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":32,"height":32}],"publishedTime":1760348500133,"voteCount":18,"postContent":{"type":"video","content":{"type":"video","videoId":"X82l37rAnP8","title":"I made an operating system from scratch - OS Dev from scratch Part 1 - Setup","author":"Developed From Scratch","authorId":"UCbUqONVVqQY4OHwr7vr22hA","description":"I decided to create my own operating system. So far however, we just have basic drawing functions, so this is just an introduction video on what it's like to work without an OS on an emulated...","viewCount":218664,"published":1760348500133,"lengthSeconds":2316,"liveNow":false,"isUpcoming":false,"isPremiere":false,"is4k":false,"is8k":false,"isNew":false,"isVr180":false,"is