,"isPremiere":false},{"type":"video","videoId":"XOZrfT4cdOI","title":"Challenges of building our own router | My talk at a RIPE regional meeting in Sofia, April 7th","author":"Tomaž Zaman","authorId":"UCdm6_F2Izi0PcVh-Vgxoh8g","viewCount":4800,"published":1760348522941,"lengthSeconds":1488,"liveNow":false,"isUpcoming":false,"isStation":false,"isPremiere":false},{"type":"video","videoId":"GTE8vdIEATs","title":"I'm DONE with u-boot!","author":"Tomaž Zaman","authorId":"UCdm6_F2Izi0PcVh-Vgxoh8g","viewCount":76000,"published":1760348522941,"lengthSeconds":1511,"liveNow":false,"isUpcoming":false,"isStation":false,"isPremiere":false},{"type":"video","videoId":"e1ZzvwjD-Dg","title":"We made a 10Gb router. In a year.","author":"Tomaž Zaman","authorId":"UCdm6_F2Izi0PcVh-Vgxoh8g","viewCount":89000,"published":1760348522941,"lengthSeconds":1911,"liveNow":false,"isUpcoming":false,"isStation":false,"isPremiere":false},{"type":"video","videoId":"fnQHAYbEl-M","title":"User Experience Matters. A Lot!","author":"Tomaž Zaman","authorId":"UCdm6_F2Izi0PcVh-Vgxoh8g","viewCount":20000,"published":1760348522941,"lengthSeconds":1108,"liveNow":false,"isUpcoming":false,"isStation":false,"isPremiere":false},{"type":"video","videoId":"2Pp6WJFUkaY","title":"Your questions about our high-end router, answered.","author":"Tomaž Zaman","authorId":"UCdm6_F2Izi0PcVh-Vgxoh8g","viewCount":29000,"published":1760348522941,"lengthSeconds":1382,"liveNow":false,"isUpcoming":false,"isStation":false,"isPremiere":false},{"type":"video","videoId":"qSQbpS9waIA","title":"We're building a high-end router. Here's the update for January 2025.","author":"Tomaž Zaman","authorId":"UCdm6_F2Izi0PcVh-Vgxoh8g","viewCount":59000,"published":1760348522941,"lengthSeconds":1426,"liveNow":false,"isUpcoming":false,"isStation":false,"isPremiere":false},{"type":"video","videoId":"Re2mn54SbHw","title":"My 10 Gb router PCB is better than your 10 Gb router PCB.","author":"Tomaž Zaman","authorId":"UCdm6_F2Izi0PcVh-Vgxoh8g","viewCount":50000,"published":1760348522941,"lengthSeconds":1344,"liveNow":false,"isUpcoming":false,"isStation":false,"isPremiere":false},{"type":"video","videoId":"ZeHIQFuN8Eg","title":"We're building a high-end router. Here's the update for December 2024.","author":"Tomaž Zaman","authorId":"UCdm6_F2Izi0PcVh-Vgxoh8g","viewCount":35000,"published":1760348522941,"lengthSeconds":821,"liveNow":false,"isUpcoming":false,"isStation":false,"isPremiere":false},{"type":"video","videoId":"NpSmz6Ssj8s","title":"I decided to DOWNSIZE my NAS. Significantly.","author":"Tomaž Zaman","authorId":"UCdm6_F2Izi0PcVh-Vgxoh8g","viewCount":20000,"published":1760348522941,"lengthSeconds":1031,"liveNow":false,"isUpcoming":false,"isStation":false,"isPremiere":false},{"type":"video","videoId":"SS1MKZY8Tus","title":"The perfect pitch doesn't exi...","author":"Tomaž Zaman","authorId":"UCdm6_F2Izi0PcVh-Vgxoh8g","viewCount":32000,"published":1760348522941,"lengthSeconds":1581,"liveNow":false,"isUpcoming":false,"isStation":false,"isPremiere":false}],"videosTimestamp":{"$$date":1791905474941},"liveStreams":[],"liveStreamsTimestamp":{"$$date":1791905445479},"shorts":[{"authorId":"UCdm6_F2Izi0PcVh-Vgxoh8g","author":"Tomaž Zaman","videoId":"JypQlBZo4Lg","title":"New keycaps (GMK Symbiote) ASMR #mechanicalkeyboard #asmr #keycaps #keyboard","published":1705423402000,"viewCount":2892,"type":"video","lengthSeconds":"0:00","isRSS":true},{"authorId":"UCdm6_F2Izi0PcVh-Vgxoh8g","author":"Tomaž Zaman","videoId":"oFr59edLfxc","title":"Ceramic keycaps ASMR","published":1677699248000,"viewCount":4871,"type":"video","lengthSeconds":"0:00","isRSS":true},{"authorId":"UCdm6_F2Izi0PcVh-Vgxoh8g","author":"Tomaž Zaman","videoId":"0OIVrSF4aYU","title":"This ATX Power Supply Fits in Your Pocket!","published":1677606103000,"viewCount":23589,"type":"video","lengthSeconds":"0:00","isRSS":true}],"shortsTimestamp":{"$$date":1791905440331},"communityPosts":[{"postText":"Need ideas - the two M.2 ports on the PCB serve different purposes.\n\nLeft one, marked 3R, stands for 3-radio and is intended primarily for home automation; It can support only Wi-Fi 5 (because it has an SPI bus for it), Bluetooth and Thread.\n\nThe right one, marked 2R, has a single PCIe 3.0 lane which should be enough for Wi-Fi 7, but those cards also come with BT support, hence 2-radio.\n\nQuestion: does 2R/3R marking sound okay or would you name it differently? I mean there will be a manual with explanation, but thinking whether we can improve these for those of us who don&apos;t read manuals? :)","postId":"UgkxEudOZT6zRMAxSEL04UIcQFeRroEbO0Tx","authorThumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/WYkWOsLhXVw0yefkTZ76LnQBj2N5gKkrdQkqHyNmzctwv-ZZS1dYkST-0gOs3pa4dnx-8_ruPQ=s76-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":76,"height":76},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/WYkWOsLhXVw0yefkTZ76LnQBj2N5gKkrdQkqHyNmzctwv-ZZS1dYkST-0gOs3pa4dnx-8_ruPQ=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":48,"height":48},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/WYkWOsLhXVw0yefkTZ76LnQBj2N5gKkrdQkqHyNmzctwv-ZZS1dYkST-0gOs3pa4dnx-8_ruPQ=s32-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":32,"height":32}],"publishedTime":1760348500662,"voteCount":97,"postContent":{"type":"image","content":[{"url":"https://yt3.ggpht.com/mCXFJ-ep-py_22p4WROHF29RyL6Mhs_qVfZxz4xmoLdTA18lirkuOGwIWhzbMJdJzoC8cgXTcZv1=s640-c-fcrop64=1,3b240000c4dbffff-rw-nd-v1","width":640,"height":640}]},"commentCount":44,"authorId":"UCdm6_F2Izi0PcVh-Vgxoh8g","author":"Tomaž Zaman","type":"community"},{"postText":"I&apos;ve put together a basic Yocto project for a 32 MB firmware image which can be flashed onto our NOR flash. Best part? You don&apos;t even need our hardware to test it, it works with Qemu!\n\nKeep in mind this is the very first attempt so there&apos;s much to improve, but as always, I welcome all of you to take a look, create an issue on GitHub if you find any or a pull request if you think we&apos;re missing anything!\n\n<a href=\"https://github.com/we-are-mono/firmware\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">github.com/we-are-mono/firmware</a>","postId":"Ugkx8oJbGfRJBtE8rUNNKdQZmku68Oa6IUxK","authorThumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/WYkWOsLhXVw0yefkTZ76LnQBj2N5gKkrdQkqHyNmzctwv-ZZS1dYkST-0gOs3pa4dnx-8_ruPQ=s76-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":76,"height":76},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/WYkWOsLhXVw0yefkTZ76LnQBj2N5gKkrdQkqHyNmzctwv-ZZS1dYkST-0gOs3pa4dnx-8_ruPQ=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":48,"height":48},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/WYkWOsLhXVw0yefkTZ76LnQBj2N5gKkrdQkqHyNmzctwv-ZZS1dYkST-0gOs3pa4dnx-8_ruPQ=s32-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":32,"height":32}],"publishedTime":1760348500662,"voteCount":131,"postContent":null,"commentCount":4,"authorId":"UCdm6_F2Izi0PcVh-Vgxoh8g","author":"Tomaž Zaman","type":"community"},{"postText":"I am speechless. \n\nOur goal was to get 1000 preorders in until end of April 2025 because our whole pricing structure was,... dependent on this - all the quotes we got from manufacturers were set to 1000 units because anything below that would make manufacturing significantly more expensive.\n\nWell, it appears we&apos;re about to reach that goal in *three days*, rather than three months.\n\nI&apos;m humbled, I&apos;m honored, and I&apos;m grateful. 🙌","postId":"UgkxDCCJz30JkwrJO5plc40PBhKgZKduSvmd","authorThumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/WYkWOsLhXVw0yefkTZ76LnQBj2N5gKkrdQkqHyNmzctwv-ZZS1dYkST-0gOs3pa4dnx-8_ruPQ=s76-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":76,"height":76},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/WYkWOsLhXVw0yefkTZ76LnQBj2N5gKkrdQkqHyNmzctwv-ZZS1dYkST-0gOs3pa4dnx-8_ruPQ=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":48,"height":48},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/WYkWOsLhXVw0yefkTZ76LnQBj2N5gKkrdQkqHyNmzctwv-ZZS1dYkST-0gOs3pa4dnx-8_ruPQ=s32-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":32,"height":32}],"publishedTime":1760348500662,"voteCount":456,"postContent":{"type":"image","content":[{"url":"https://yt3.ggpht.com/7Ts1Hz7VgBxpQZeV06WHF9nWKcsgo1tknt9-xgeOH5jk4EcbC4VutMQw8SdmMYJn9LW9eQIgN_HH-w=s544-c-fcrop64=1,0ef60000f109ffff-rw-nd-v1","width":544,"height":544}]},"commentCount":25,"authorId":"UCdm6_F2Izi0PcVh-Vgxoh8g","author":"Tomaž Zaman","type":"community"},{"postText":"A couple of snippets from our first evening of the board bringup. Bottom line: we could successfully &quot;talk&quot; to the CPU with JTAG. That&apos;s great news, means no major issues with the board.","postId":"Ugkx_b2veZXecfmvJcF6QPUgr_zTsofZWMjg","authorThumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/WYkWOsLhXVw0yefkTZ76LnQBj2N5gKkrdQkqHyNmzctwv-ZZS1dYkST-0gOs3pa4dnx-8_ruPQ=s76-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":76,"height":76},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/WYkWOsLhXVw0yefkTZ76LnQBj2N5gKkrdQkqHyNmzctwv-ZZS1dYkST-0gOs3pa4dnx-8_ruPQ=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":48,"height":48},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/WYkWOsLhXVw0yefkTZ76LnQBj2N5gKkrdQkqHyNmzctwv-ZZS1dYkST-0gOs3pa4dnx-8_ruPQ=s32-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":32,"height":32}],"publishedTime":1760348500662,"voteCount":220,"postContent":{"type":"multiImage","content":[[{"url":"https://yt3.ggpht.com/r-Y5ej5kZtnx8sdX11X8szCKVEufJPV1wk-3QmtE5IvHC5XyYfuAkjK3ZrVk2sPb_9vqX76uVdSeybE=s640-c-fcrop64=1,2ad60000d529ffff-rw-nd-v1","width":640,"height":640}],[{"url":"https://yt3.ggpht.com/UHQIfYpb33KO4_F4IcIrHfVQrnGoDcp9LFaH2EH02omuCldQn-d5x9P3YS6XgDtZATb8nhwl7QvN=s640-c-fcrop64=1,2ad60000d529ffff-rw-nd-v1","width":640,"height":640}],[{"url":"https://yt3.ggpht.com/me7NkNTw7ljIB3Mur0D0PZBGQiN5u2IAQRo5KlTqRjIm8zeLXN4EcmprICY-yiU-W20Xwqxns6l95vE=s640-c-fcrop64=1,00002ad6ffffd529-rw-nd-v1","width":640,"height":640}],[{"url":"https://yt3.ggpht.com/qFW_f3rMc3BNUzPadLX-zwxTtrMNQyp4qzbgYk-Mojuu6UZBZvHeTimuLJ3MGVl9p_e3H5mqvS4o4A=s640-c-fcrop64=1,2ad60000d529ffff-rw-nd-v1","width":640,"height":640}]]},"commentCount":7,"authorId":"UCdm6_F2Izi0PcVh-Vgxoh8g","author":"Tomaž Zaman","type":"community"},{"postText":"Fresh out of the oven!","postId":"Ugkxbwh2Q9ZdQcPECxzffNrEzP1XTQnHhcR4","authorThumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/WYkWOsLhXVw0yefkTZ76LnQBj2N5gKkrdQkqHyNmzctwv-ZZS1dYkST-0gOs3pa4dnx-8_ruPQ=s76-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":76,"height":76},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/WYkWOsLhXVw0yefkTZ76LnQBj2N5gKkrdQkqHyNmzctwv-ZZS1dYkST-0gOs3pa4dnx-8_ruPQ=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":48,"height":48},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/WYkWOsLhXVw0yefkTZ76LnQBj2N5gKkrdQkqHyNmzctwv-ZZS1dYkST-0gOs3pa4dnx-8_ruPQ=s32-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":32,"height":32}],"publishedTime":1760348500662,"voteCount":723,"postContent":{"type":"multiImage","content":[[{"url":"https://yt3.ggpht.com/M5pLZp3IsKGs9NxVePU2zGegamDSBjCw9nFCLw8okPpFkZyxC3iU2yOoTH-ulbQfAfAIWNJ2eNZLpw=s640-c-fcrop64=1,2ab00000d54fffff-rw-nd-v1","width":640,"height":640}],[{"url":"https://yt3.ggpht.com/E9lynRz0xCDi5Hol7OA6DrRx_hAlHU1JPufB5_bdThR1qF0LOoA4L2eUL3FseeMJ9nzeTo92poEWeQ=s640-c-fcrop64=1,2ab00000d54fffff-rw-nd-v1","width":640,"height":640}],[{"url":"https://yt3.ggpht.com/Sdxv5H5gS5exIi--EjnhaavpcNK9ODm8aCV0KDVCfeDR8uNYe-iFH8CBuOQFKRBiV10tOxwE5PaY2lg=s640-c-fcrop64=1,2ab00000d54fffff-rw-nd-v1","width":640,"height":640}],[{"url":"https://yt3.ggpht.com/ZMsxxV2xKud9nxvZo9j3k8McB5jK9jQW8GcEFwjX6XUBOcoFvhTiAum6grWBNI6uS8YtR80l5a18=s640-c-fcrop64=1,2ab00000d54fffff-rw-nd-v1","width":640,"height":640}]]},"commentCount":67,"authorId":"UCdm6_F2Izi0PcVh-Vgxoh8g","author":"Tomaž Zaman","type":"community"},{"postText":"Question. \n\nI&apos;m preparing a series of videos on how to convert a Raspberry Pi into a full-fledged homelab - literally step-by-step. Is it unethical to show how to install software that allows pirating? I&apos;m talking specifically about Radarr/Sonarr/Torrents. I don&apos;t plan to show any kind of illegal activities (for obvious reasons), but this software can be used for those so I&apos;m wondering whether it&apos;s okay for me to include this - for educational purposes only.\n\nWhat do you think?","postId":"Ugkxf4hMeR-nLqHOOxXXI8LjHbs9QLGk0DvW","authorThumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/WYkWOsLhXVw0yefkTZ76LnQBj2N5gKkrdQkqHyNmzctwv-ZZS1dYkST-0gOs3pa4dnx-8_ruPQ=s76-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":76,"height":76},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/WYkWOsLhXVw0yefkTZ76LnQBj2N5gKkrdQkqHyNmzctwv-ZZS1dYkST-0gOs3pa4dnx-8_ruPQ=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":48,"height":48},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/WYkWOsLhXVw0yefkTZ76LnQBj2N5gKkrdQkqHyNmzctwv-ZZS1dYkST-0gOs3pa4dnx-8_ruPQ=s32-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":32,"height":32}],"publishedTime":1760348500662,"voteCount":197,"postContent":{"type":"image","content":[{"url":"https://yt3.ggpht.com/FRz3av8S6NLO-a_5tbhzTTshtCSrHW7Xfko6eSKfDqrM3Cj8I-Hhh4fIwO-aE6_bivvrtuuukpN1JqA=s640-c-fcrop64=1,00000c84fffff37b-rw-nd-v1","width":640,"height":640}]},"commentCount":84,"authorId":"UCdm6_F2Izi0PcVh-Vgxoh8g","author":"Tomaž Zaman","type":"community"},{"postText":"To no one&apos;s suprise, ISP-provided routers are the least satisfactory solution out there. Only 12% would recommend them! (N=864)\n\nIf you haven&apos;t yet, help us out by filling out this survey here: <a href=\"https://forms.gle/aVBwDLjSoeTezv9A8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">forms.gle/aVBwDLjSoeTezv9A8</a>","postId":"UgkxE-pP-RjaWzrq9Aa4CWQEV3KQlMtzCvt7","authorThumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/WYkWOsLhXVw0yefkTZ76LnQBj2N5gKkrdQkqHyNmzctwv-ZZS1dYkST-0gOs3pa4dnx-8_ruPQ=s76-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":76,"height":76},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/WYkWOsLhXVw0yefkTZ76LnQBj2N5gKkrdQkqHyNmzctwv-ZZS1dYkST-0gOs3pa4dnx-8_ruPQ=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":48,"height":48},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/WYkWOsLhXVw0yefkTZ76LnQBj2N5gKkrdQkqHyNmzctwv-ZZS1dYkST-0gOs3pa4dnx-8_ruPQ=s32-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":32,"height":32}],"publishedTime":1760348500662,"voteCount":88,"postContent":{"type":"image","content":[{"url":"https://yt3.ggpht.com/QKFkKSfHETdwKHtQTUNW_EKveFixAPVN3zmGTm9-GPy-b8zeyUV3DfaGouIt03CgzAfEtSbIf9umtA=s640-c-fcrop64=1,00000c9efffff361-rw-nd-v1","width":640,"height":640}]},"commentCount":14,"authorId":"UCdm6_F2Izi0PcVh-Vgxoh8g","author":"Tomaž Zaman","type":"community"},{"postText":"I have to share this, because it&apos;s too good not to. Some of you have doubted the performance capabilities of our chosen ARM CPU for the router we&apos;re developing, so here are some raw numbers. This is the preliminary test of the custom Applications Solutions Kit that NXP provides and in the screenshot you see shows routing between two separate networks, each plugged into it&apos;s own 10Gb port on their reference design board.\nThere&apos;s a couple of firewall rules being configured, but their number shouldn&apos;t matter (working on a video in which I explain why not).\n\nAnd the best part? All four general purpose ARM A72 cores are at IDLE, and the power consumption difference between this test running and not running is a WHOPPING 1.2 watts :D\n\nSuper happy with this result.","postId":"UgkxQAcYTjUgN2C91Ddds2VTzPanfdTLB0q9","authorThumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/WYkWOsLhXVw0yefkTZ76LnQBj2N5gKkrdQkqHyNmzctwv-ZZS1dYkST-0gOs3pa4dnx-8_ruPQ=s76-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":76,"height":76},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/WYkWOsLhXVw0yefkTZ76LnQBj2N5gKkrdQkqHyNmzctwv-ZZS1dYkST-0gOs3pa4dnx-8_ruPQ=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":48,"height":48},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/WYkWOsLhXVw0yefkTZ76LnQBj2N5gKkrdQkqHyNmzctwv-ZZS1dYkST-0gOs3pa4dnx-8_ruPQ=s32-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":32,"height":32}],"publishedTime":1760348500662,"voteCount":340,"postContent":{"type":"image","content":[{"url":"https://yt3.ggpht.com/sjTND_t3elEXbbn8cpkzKVQ3whuLhz1kxkIVOcRF95nNmfpugvIqXQ4-kNe00BsRqFO9HHtmr5QHAUg=s640-c-fcrop64=1,0f760000f089ffff-rw-nd-v1","width":640,"height":640}]},"commentCount":51,"authorId":"UCdm6_F2Izi0PcVh-Vgxoh8g","author":"Tomaž Zaman","type":"community"},{"postText":"Just received samples for the M.2 latches. The beauty of these is that the mounting is completely tool-less, both to mount these latches onto the PCB and then to latch the M.2 module on. All we need to do is prepare correctly shaped mounting hole on the PCB.\n\nWhat do you think?","postId":"UgkxUSOnBR31i2U9Ek5Elyku2WCBMeIh_6-K","authorThumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/WYkWOsLhXVw0yefkTZ76LnQBj2N5gKkrdQkqHyNmzctwv-ZZS1dYkST-0gOs3pa4dnx-8_ruPQ=s76-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":76,"height":76},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/WYkWOsLhXVw0yefkTZ76LnQBj2N5gKkrdQkqHyNmzctwv-ZZS1dYkST-0gOs3pa4dnx-8_ruPQ=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":48,"height":48},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/WYkWOsLhXVw0yefkTZ76LnQBj2N5gKkrdQkqHyNmzctwv-ZZS1dYkST-0gOs3pa4dnx-8_ruPQ=s32-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":32,"height":32}],"publishedTime":1728791548663,"voteCount":79,"postContent":{"type":"image","content":[{"url":"https://yt3.ggpht.com/ySZpQZ-ZMYbyD5EhBehuuU2_Dh4iVE7U9ckoZhUdrxK7L0a3BSI-TP9QSEjWiaMExLkhAmPQwHww2Zw=s640-c-fcrop64=1,2ab00000d54fffff-rw-nd-v1","width":640,"height":640}]},"commentCount":10,"authorId":"UCdm6_F2Izi0PcVh-Vgxoh8g","author":"Tomaž Zaman","type":"community"},{"postText":"Build done. This one will go to one of my subscribers. Giveaway in Tuesday ;)","postId":"UgkxbdJkiV9P5kJczHtyaGRMSBFDBP1AXel1","authorThumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/WYkWOsLhXVw0yefkTZ76LnQBj2N5gKkrdQkqHyNmzctwv-ZZS1dYkST-0gOs3pa4dnx-8_ruPQ=s76-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":76,"height":76},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/WYkWOsLhXVw0yefkTZ76LnQBj2N5gKkrdQkqHyNmzctwv-ZZS1dYkST-0gOs3pa4dnx-8_ruPQ=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":48,"height":48},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/WYkWOsLhXVw0yefkTZ76LnQBj2N5gKkrdQkqHyNmzctwv-ZZS1dYkST-0gOs3pa4dnx-8_ruPQ=s32-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":32,"height":32}],"publishedTime":1728791548663,"voteCount":87,"postContent":{"type":"im