 the Ship of Theseus? Secondly, if those removed planks are restored and reassembled, free of the rot, is that the Ship of Theseus?&quot;\n\nStream <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/wandavision\">#WandaVision</a> and prepare for Marvel Television&apos;s <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/visionquest\">#VisionQuest</a>, streaming October 14 on Disney+.","postId":"UgkxdPIXP0_2v1InUSg8G2STVYV-GSAYL6T6","authorThumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/k7BhK-hm9_MbJbaKznHPhir6e4pWXbm1ppAHoseLIzRgoAPBMmH1IIhYKlXbGono25RD1OQwHQ=s76-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":76,"height":76},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/k7BhK-hm9_MbJbaKznHPhir6e4pWXbm1ppAHoseLIzRgoAPBMmH1IIhYKlXbGono25RD1OQwHQ=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":48,"height":48},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/k7BhK-hm9_MbJbaKznHPhir6e4pWXbm1ppAHoseLIzRgoAPBMmH1IIhYKlXbGono25RD1OQwHQ=s32-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":32,"height":32}],"publishedTime":1791826252123,"voteCount":14000,"postContent":{"type":"image","content":[{"url":"https://yt3.ggpht.com/39RdFbi8KSlB4JOw4MPFknZK-mcp5Y0g-wSB1UJ6WAe3JUVF7Gw8q_tVaAPz-HXMNZIulWHJK-bYkmI=s640-c-fcrop64=1,000018a4fffff8a3-rw-nd-v1","width":640,"height":640}]},"commentCount":237,"authorId":"UCvC4D8onUfXzvjTOM-dBfEA","author":"Marvel Entertainment","type":"community"},{"postText":"It&apos;s a Wanda and Vision thing. \n\nStream Wanda and Vision’s <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/mcu\">#MCU</a> story and prepare for <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/visionquest\">#VisionQuest</a>, streaming October 14 on Disney+.","postId":"UgkxGEwAQz8loEBQGA083Zu3ChZoFiWnYzpd","authorThumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/k7BhK-hm9_MbJbaKznHPhir6e4pWXbm1ppAHoseLIzRgoAPBMmH1IIhYKlXbGono25RD1OQwHQ=s76-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":76,"height":76},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/k7BhK-hm9_MbJbaKznHPhir6e4pWXbm1ppAHoseLIzRgoAPBMmH1IIhYKlXbGono25RD1OQwHQ=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":48,"heig